{"speciesId":160,"names":{"fr":"Aligatueur","es":"Feraligatr","en":"Feraligatr","ja":"オーダイル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"When it bites with its massive and powerful jaws, it shakes its head and savagely tears its victim up."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It is hard for it to support its own weight out of water, so it gets down on all fours. But it moves fast."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"Although it has a massive body, its powerful hind legs enable it to move quickly, even on the ground."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"FERALIGATR intimidates its foes by opening its huge mouth. In battle, it will kick the ground hard with its thick and powerful hind legs to charge at the foe at an incredible speed."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"FERALIGATR intimidates its foes by opening its huge mouth. In battle, it will kick the ground hard with its thick and powerful hind legs to charge at the foe at an incredible speed."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It opens its huge mouth to intimidate enemies. In battle, it runs using its thick and powerful hind legs to charge the foe with incredible speed."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It is hard for it to support its own weight out of water, so it gets down on all fours. But it moves fast."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"When it bites with its massive and powerful jaws, it shakes its head and savagely tears up its victim."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It usually moves slowly, but it goes at blinding speed when it attacks and bites prey."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It usually moves slowly, but it goes at blinding speed when it attacks and bites prey."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It usually moves slowly, but it goes at blinding speed when it attacks and bites prey."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"When it bites with its massive and powerful jaws, it shakes its head and savagely tears its victim up."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It is hard for it to support its weight out of water, so it sometimes gets down on all fours. But it moves fast."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ce Pokémon à l’air pataud est capable d’attaquer à la vitesse de l’éclair pour mordre sa proie."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It usually moves slowly, but it goes at blinding speed when it attacks and bites prey."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ce Pokémon à l’air pataud est capable d’attaquer à la vitesse de l’éclair pour mordre sa proie."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It usually moves slowly, but it goes at blinding speed when it attacks and bites prey."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It usually moves slowly, but it goes at blinding speed when it attacks and bites prey."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It usually moves slowly, but it goes at blinding speed when it attacks and bites prey."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ce Pokémon à l’air pataud est capable d’attaquer à la vitesse de l’éclair pour mordre sa proie."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se suele mover lento, pero alcanza velocidades de vértigo al atacar y morder a sus enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It usually moves slowly, but it goes at blinding speed when it attacks and bites prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"普段は ゆっくりとした 動きだが 獲物に かみつくときは 目にも 止まらない スピードだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Quand il mord avec sa puissante mâchoire, il secoue sa tête pour déchiqueter sa pauvre victime."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Al morder con sus feroces fauces, mueve su cabeza despedazando salvajemente a su víctima."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"When it bites with its massive and powerful jaws, it shakes its head and savagely tears its victim up."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"大きく 力強い アゴで かみつくと そのまま 首を振って 相手を ずたずたに 引きちぎる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Aligatueur impressionne ses ennemis en ouvrant son énorme gueule. Pendant les combats, il piétine le sol de ses puissantes pattes arrière avant de charger ses adversaires à pleine vitesse."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Feraligatr intimida a sus oponentes abriendo las grandes fauces que tiene. En combate, golpea el suelo bruscamente con las gruesas y fuertes patas traseras que tiene para cargar contra su rival a una velocidad de vértigo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Feraligatr intimidates its foes by opening its huge mouth. In battle, it will kick the ground hard with its thick and powerful hind legs to charge at the foe at an incredible speed."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"大きな 口を 開けて 相手を 威嚇する。 強靭な 後ろ足で 地面を 蹴って ものすごい スピードで 突進 してくるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Aligatueur impressionne ses ennemis en ouvrant son énorme gueule. Pendant les combats, il piétine le sol de ses puissantes pattes arrière avant de charger ses adversaires à pleine vitesse."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Feraligatr intimida a sus oponentes abriendo las grandes fauces que tiene. En combate, golpea el suelo bruscamente con las gruesas y fuertes patas traseras que tiene para cargar contra su rival a una velocidad de vértigo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Feraligatr intimidates its foes by opening its huge mouth. In battle, it will kick the ground hard with its thick and powerful hind legs to charge at the foe at an incredible speed."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"大きな 口を 開けて 相手を 威嚇する。 強靭な 後ろ足で 地面を 蹴って ものすごい スピードで 突進 してくるぞ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":160,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"